{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "59", "x": 0.9032117274603759, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03053152114325986, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Sword's team brainstormed potential fixes. Any rule that existed, they talked", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8261208822518334, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "about changing-from changing the bats to changing the geometry of the field. But", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8266556524108795, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "while all of these were ruled out as potential fixes, ABS was seen as a perfect", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8259902654606861, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "vehicle for change. According to Sword, once you get the technology right, you", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8259031192499521, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "can load any strike zone you want into the system. \"It might be a triangle, or a blob,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8267764268064615, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "or something shaped like Texas. Over time, as baseball evolves, ABS can allow the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8261208822518334, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "zone to change with it.\"", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.24197957538880283, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "\"In the past twenty years, sports have moved away from judgment calls. Soccer", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.33133430071101805, "w": 0.8261205746769721, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "has Video Assistant Referees (for offside decisions, for example). Tennis has", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3596646507851557, "w": 0.8266567801853713, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Hawk-Eye (for line calls, for example). For almost a decade, baseball has used", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38799500085929334, "w": 0.8261418998673634, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "instant replay on the base paths. This is widely liked, even if the precision can", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41632538865482344, "w": 0.8260121032758466, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sometimes cause problems. But these applications deal with something physical:", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4446557764503536, "w": 0.8268327130061003, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "bases, lines, goals. The boundaries of action are precise, delineated like the keys", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.47301087175797835, "w": 0.8259900604107785, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of a piano. This is not the case with ABS and the strike zone. Historically, a certain", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5013412218321159, "w": 0.8261207797268797, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "discretion has been appreciated.\"", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5295232891122934, "w": 0.3449830131530289, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "I decided to email Alva Noe, a professor at Berkeley University and a baseball fan,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5677915286503784, "w": 0.8266049025587461, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "for his opinion. \"Hardly a day goes by that I don't wake up and run through the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5961219164459085, "w": 0.8257942377490113, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "reasons that this [robe-umpires] is such a terrible idea,\" he replied. He later told", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6244523042414386, "w": 0.8262138723849345, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "me, \"This is part of a movement to use algorithms to take the hard choices of living", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6527826543155762, "w": 0.8266322767214119, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "out of life.\" Perhaps he's right. We watch baseball to kill time, not to maximize it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6811501222399445, "w": 0.8260768990466512, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Some players I have met take a dissenting stance toward the robots too, believing", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7094804723140822, "w": 0.826229353652959, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that accuracy is not the answer. According to Joe Russo, who plays for a New", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7378108223882198, "w": 0.8266515514127272, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Jersey team, \"With technology, people just want everything to be perfect. That's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7661412479051425, "w": 0.8260988393867654, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "not reality. I think perfect would be weird. Your teams are always winning, work is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7944715979792801, "w": 0.8259463847804577, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "always just great, there's always money in your pocket, your car never breaks", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8228019480534177, "w": 0.8267715056086788, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "down. What is there to talk about?\"", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8509839776122027, "w": 0.36151193241801105, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "* strike: a strike is when the batter swings at a ball and misses or when the batter", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8892770001051672, "w": 0.8261206772019258, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "does not swing at a ball that passes through the strike zone.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9176073501793048, "w": 0.6141659702659179, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}